Description: Y5 Wayland compositor (full bundle)
 y5 is a Wayland compositor with a pannable/zoomable desktop, screen capture,
 and integrated developer tooling.
 .
 This package ships the production compositor (DRM/KMS backend), the settings
 editor, developer log viewer, polkit agent, patched xwayland-satellite, MX
 Master gesture daemon, and display-manager session files.
 .
 Before starting a session, run `y5.compositor.settings` to create
 ~/.config/y5.compositor/settings.json.
